end":"2026-10-25T09:50:20+00:00","future":true,"finished":false,"permalink":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/class/campeonato-de-andalucia-de-aguas-interiores-de-optimist/?wcs_timestamp=1792918220","buttons":[],"meta":[]},{"title":"Asamblea general extraordinaria del Club N\u00e1utico Sevilla","id":91611,"thumbnail":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/wp-content/uploads/JPGescudo.jpg","thumbnail_size":false,"multiday":false,"ending":"","duration":"1h","terms":[],"period":60,"excerpt":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELos socios de Honor, Fundadores y Numerarios del Club N\u00e1utico Sevilla est\u00e1n citados de forma presencial y telem\u00e1tica el domingo 25 de octubre de 2026 a las 11:00 horas en primera convocatoria y/o a las 11:15 horas en segunda.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/wp-content/uploads/Comunicado-JD-CNS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&#8230;\u003C/p\u003E\n","hash":"33a18108bc517fe95ae0ab15d7664fb5","visible":true,"timestamp":1792926000,"last":false,"start":"2026-10-25T11:00:00+00:00","end":"2026-10-25T12:00:00+00:00","future":true,"finished":false,"permalink":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/class/asamblea-general-extraordinaria-del-club-nautico-sevilla-3/?wcs_timestamp=1792926000","buttons":[],"meta":[]},{"title":"Club de Lectura del Club N\u00e1utico","id":91525,"thumbnail":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/wp-content/uploads/Club-de-Lectura-2026-10-27.jpg","thumbnail_size":false,"multiday":false,"ending":"","duration":"1h 35'","terms":[],"period":95,"excerpt":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESi eres un amante de la lectura, te esperamos\u00a0\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eel martes 27 de octubre a las 19:00 horas para comentar \u2018Las mil vidas del profesor Bonham\u2019 con la presencia de su autor, Juan Luis Ortiz Hidalgo, en la sexta convocatoria del a\u00f1o del Club de Lectura del N\u00e1utico.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&#8230;\u003C/p\u003E\n","hash":"51f3706d826c97324b791f7e561c2984","visible":true,"timestamp":1793127600,"last":false,"start":"2026-10-27T19:00:00+00:00","end":"2026-10-27T20:35:00+00:00","future":true,"finished":false,"permalink":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/class/club-de-lectura-del-club-nautico-4/?wcs_timestamp=1793127600","buttons":[],"meta":[]},{"title":"Conferencia 'La Armada Invencible' y la contraarmada inglesa","id":91730,"thumbnail":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/wp-content/uploads/Charla-28-octubre.jpeg","thumbnail_size":false,"multiday":false,"ending":"","duration":"1h","terms":[],"period":60,"excerpt":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEl mi\u00e9rcoles 28 de octubre a las 19:30 horas en los salones sociales del Club N\u00e1utico Sevilla impartida por el capit\u00e1n de nav\u00edo y doctor en Historia Enrique Tapias\u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E, en acto organizado por la Real Asamblea Espa\u00f1ola de Capitanes de Yate (RAECY). \u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEntrada libre hasta completar aforo.\u003C/...\n\u003C/p\u003E\n","hash":"bbc08b0fee330f838ec32d3f1c88b979","visible":true,"timestamp":1793215800,"last":false,"start":"2026-10-28T19:30:00+00:00","end":"2026-10-28T20:30:00+00:00","future":true,"finished":false,"permalink":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/class/conferencia-la-armada-invencible-y-la-contraarmada-inglesa/?wcs_timestamp=1793215800","buttons":[],"meta":[]},{"title":"Tertulia gastron\u00f3mica Jubijueves","id":91717,"thumbnail":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/wp-content/uploads/JUBIJUEVES-oct-2026.jpg","thumbnail_size":false,"multiday":false,"ending":"","duration":"1h","terms":[],"period":60,"excerpt":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELa tertulia de jubilados del Club N\u00e1utico, abierta al cuerpo social, inicia el nuevo oto\u00f1o el jueves 29 de octubre a las 14:30 h en el sal\u00f3n social. \u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESe ruega confirmaci\u00f3n de asistencia, hasta el lunes 26 como fecha l\u00edmite, en la oficina o el tel\u00e9fono 678 48 69 52.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E#SomosN\u00e1utico\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003C...\n\u003C/p\u003E\n","hash":"9d2f8d310b7ef922d9f3df65f6893a39","visible":true,"timestamp":1793284200,"last":false,"start":"2026-10-29T14:30:00+00:00","end":"2026-10-29T15:30:00+00:00","future":true,"finished":false,"permalink":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/class/tertulia-gastronomica-jubijueves-52/?wcs_timestamp=1793284200","buttons":[],"meta":[]},{"title":"Concierto de la Hispanidad en el Club N\u00e1utico","id":91724,"thumbnail":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/wp-content/uploads/Concierto-30-oct.jpeg","thumbnail_size":false,"multiday":false,"ending":"","duration":"1h 20'","terms":[],"period":80,"excerpt":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEl viernes 30 de octubre a las 20:00 horas con la actuaci\u00f3n de la Banda de m\u00fasica del Conservatorio Profesional de M\u00fasica de Osuna, en acto enmarcado en el Octubre Hispanoamericano de Sevilla organizado por el Grupo Cultural Ulises, integrado por el \u003C/strong\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAteneo Social y Castrense de Sevilla, la Asociaci\u00f3n &#8230;\u003C/p\u003E\n","hash":"cae07bfe32096217799c4100f05e701a","visible":true,"timestamp":1793390400,"last":false,"start":"2026-10-30T20:00:00+00:00","end":"2026-10-30T21:20:00+00:00","future":true,"finished":false,"permalink":"https://clubnauticosevilla.com/class/concierto-de-la-hispanidad-en-el-club-nautico/?wcs_timestamp=1793390400","buttons":[],"meta":[]}],"filters":{"visible":true,"options":{"label_toggle":""},"taxonomies":[]},"options":{"action":"wcs_update_schedule","wp_nonce":"413ede44bf","view":"12","days":"28","limit":0,"title":"Calendario","single":"","id":"1","label_wcs_type":"","label_filter_wcs_type":"","show_wcs_type":false,"show_filter_wcs_type":false,"label_wcs_room":"","label_filter_wcs_room":"","show_wcs_room":false,"show_filter_wcs_room":false,"label_wcs_inst